        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look at Me” is a first-person horror game in which the player is chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playtime : 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo developed by S.P Dream of Guinea Pigs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player finds themselves in the middle of a creepy hallway, being chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clown is chasing you—but if you try to stare at it, it freezes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=276 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway is often dark. Press the F key to use your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=354 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while performing other tasks (like entering a password or pushing a button), the clown can interrupt you. This means you need to complete tasks quickly or strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look at Me” is a first-person horror game in which the player is chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Playtime : 60 min</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Solo developed by S.P Dream of Guinea Pigs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player finds themselves in the middle of a creepy hallway, being chased by a clown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=180 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/206fd3122fc9e1601fd01980701475a6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A clown is chasing you—but if you try to stare at it, it freezes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=276 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/53080cd31bb9ac8f695b4e7bc47d4ed6.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hallway is often dark. Press the F key to use your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.poster.avif?t=1763659062\" width=354 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.webm?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966380/extras/6707e0ecd6f1ff54424e9abef68096bf.mp4?t=1763659062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while performing other tasks (like entering a password or pushing a button), the clown can interrupt you. This means you need to complete tasks quickly or strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;This horror game is inspired by elements of Little Nightmares 2 and SCP. Players must solve puzzles and complete tasks (e.g., entering a password) while being chased by a clown. If you’re looking for a thrill, this game is for you.&quot;",
